pixelCharStyle
  retro 1980s Sierra adventure game character portrait, VGA 256-color pixel art in the style of classic DOS games, comedic cartoonish adult character art with exaggerated features, chunky readable pixels, bold outlines, bright saturated colors, limited 80s video palette, 320x200 resolution aesthetic, no anti-aliasing, crisp blocky pixels, full body character sprite showing the entire body from the top of the head down to the soles of the feet, head to foot full body retro pixel portrait, the character's feet are visible at the bottom of the frame, full-length standing character pose facing forward toward the viewer, front view only, single character only, only one viewing angle, the character takes up the full height of the image, transparent background, masterpiece retro pixel art, crisp clean pixels, no blur, no background

pixelSceneStyle
  retro 1980s Sierra adventure game background scenery, VGA 256-color pixel art in the style of classic DOS games, detailed hand-painted pixel scenes with chunky readable pixels, bold outlines, bright saturated colors, limited 80s video palette, 320x200 resolution aesthetic, atmospheric retro lighting with warm and cool gradients, no characters, masterpiece retro pixel art, crisp clean pixels, no anti-aliasing, no blur

pixelMapStyle
  detailed retro pixel art map, top-down adventure game map in the style of 1980s Sierra games, VGA 256-color pixel art, vibrant colors, clean chunky pixels with clear landmarks and labeled locations, detailed terrain features, forests rivers mountains buildings, game map aesthetic, no characters, crisp pixels, no anti-aliasing

pixelPovStyle
  retro 1980s Sierra adventure game scene viewed from first person POV, VGA 256-color pixel art in the style of classic DOS games, comedic cartoonish adult scene with exaggerated details, view of the scene through the character's eyes with foreground and background layers, chunky readable pixels, bold outlines, bright saturated colors, limited 80s video palette, 320x200 resolution aesthetic, detailed retro environment and background matching the scene location, depth and perspective, masterpiece retro pixel art, crisp clean pixels, no anti-aliasing, no blur

