// Randomization lists for NPC variety
// First names and surnames are split AND tagged by cultural origin so that a character's
// first name and surname always come from the same origin (no "Sakura Schmidt" mismatches).
// Scenarios select which origins are allowed (e.g. the anime/sandbox scenario uses Japanese
// names exclusively). For furry scenarios, names are instead generated by AI based on the
// character's species and description.
