$meta
  title = Leisure Suit Larry - A VGN Video Game Network Game
  description = An AI-powered pixel-art adventure game in the style of Leisure Suit Larry, from The Video Game Network. Choose your story, meet unforgettable characters, and shape the narrative through your choices. Retro 80s comedy, romance, and glorious disaster. Original PixelSaga engine created by Mazohyst — play it at perchance.org/pixelsaga.
  image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/94d1658f41478bdf20b8090d24639942.jpg

